window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>THE HUNTER AIMED FOR MY HEART… AND CAPTURED IT.</b></p> <p>I was locked out of Neverra—a death sentence for faeries born on the isle. Unless I found a way back home, the fire in my veins would extinguish, and with it, my life.</p> <p>That was how I ended up stuck on Earth, with for only companion, a grumpy hunter who hated me for what I was and what I'd done. If I'd known marking him would carry my voice into his mind, I would've kept my magic to myself.</p> <p>No… that wasn't true. I would've marked him sooner. After all, I was mute, so no one had ever heard my voice, until him.</p> <p>Unfortunately, it wasn't only my voice he could hear, but also my heart, and how wildly it beat for him.</p> <p><i>Lily and Kajika's story is a grumpy-sunshine, paranormal romance stand-alone with a HEA.</i></p>"; 
